WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.167
- The Rebel Alliance insignia
is atop her tiny head.

00:00:05.065 --> 00:00:08.006
(light instrumental music)

00:00:08.006 --> 00:00:10.207
- I don't think I was an animal person

00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:11.395
until I had these rabbits.

00:00:11.395 --> 00:00:13.401
So, before this year I
was kinda going through

00:00:13.401 --> 00:00:15.864
this three to four year isolation binge,

00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:18.029
and then I met someone and she happened to

00:00:18.029 --> 00:00:20.718
have one rabbit and ever since then I just

00:00:20.718 --> 00:00:23.791
blossomed in this relationship,
we now live together,

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:25.224
and now we have two rabbits.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.276
- I'm here today to get
a tattoo of my daughter.

00:00:27.276 --> 00:00:28.786
She's a black cat named Jyn.

00:00:28.786 --> 00:00:30.440
I picked the name Jyn for a reason.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.986
She's named after the character
in Rogue One, Jyn Erso.

00:00:33.986 --> 00:00:35.573
When I adopted Jyn.

00:00:35.573 --> 00:00:38.557
She was actually adopted
as a kitten by a family.

00:00:38.557 --> 00:00:41.909
The family ended up abandoning
her and she was literally

00:00:41.909 --> 00:00:45.091
found wandering the streets in the rain.

00:00:45.091 --> 00:00:48.510
It's so cheesy, but I'm a cat lady

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.550
and she's really one of my best friends

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.762
and I want her immortalized on me forever.

00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:53.976
- I am Adam Parrot.

00:00:53.976 --> 00:00:57.098
I am a tattooer here in
Los Angeles, California

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:58.825
at Rabble Rouser Tattoo.

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:01.383
I've been tattooing a
little over 10 years.

00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:03.901
I'm excited to give people
tattoos of their pets

00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:07.563
so they can have them with them forever.

00:01:07.563 --> 00:01:08.396
How's it going?

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:09.890
I'm Adam. I'm gonna be your tattooer.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.019
What are you looking to do today?

00:01:11.019 --> 00:01:12.467
- [Tyler] I'm getting my
rabbits tattooed today.

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:13.729
- [Adam] And what are their names?

00:01:13.729 --> 00:01:15.752
- [Tyler] So, the big
one is named Jiji after

00:01:15.752 --> 00:01:17.769
the black cat in Kiki's Delivery Service,

00:01:17.769 --> 00:01:19.807
and the little one is Kiki.

00:01:19.807 --> 00:01:23.682
- We are getting a tattoo of
my daughter who is a black cat.

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:26.122
It's gonna be going on
the back of my left calf.

00:01:26.122 --> 00:01:26.955
- Okay.

00:01:26.955 --> 00:01:29.192
- I'm looking to get something on my arm.

00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:31.649
I'm thinking like somewhere in this area.

00:01:31.649 --> 00:01:34.929
- Okay and then you mentioned
having it also framed?

00:01:34.929 --> 00:01:37.757
- Yes, I'd love to have some
kind of frame around her.

00:01:37.757 --> 00:01:39.724
I'm pretty much open to
anything as long as at the

00:01:39.724 --> 00:01:41.324
end of it there's a cat on me.

00:01:41.324 --> 00:01:42.407
- Okay, cool.

00:01:43.659 --> 00:01:44.659
Thanks guys!

00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:47.795
Alright, you ready to check it out?

00:01:47.795 --> 00:01:48.753
- I'm so excited!

00:01:48.753 --> 00:01:49.586
- [Adam] Alright.

00:01:49.586 --> 00:01:50.439
Here's what we got.

00:01:50.439 --> 00:01:51.713
- Oh my God, yes! I love it.

00:01:51.713 --> 00:01:52.668
That's amazing.

00:01:52.668 --> 00:01:55.663
I mean, that looks exactly
like what they love eating.

00:01:55.663 --> 00:01:56.746
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:57.712 --> 00:01:58.723
I love it.

00:01:58.723 --> 00:02:01.163
I want to put this in a locket

00:02:01.163 --> 00:02:03.448
like fuck getting it on my calf

00:02:03.448 --> 00:02:05.291
we're just gonna do it on my face.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.792
Put this on my body now!

00:02:06.792 --> 00:02:07.873
- Awesome.

00:02:07.873 --> 00:02:11.290
(alternative rock music)

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:30.847
