00:02:30.847 --> 00:02:31.680
Check it out?

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:32.513
- Yes.

00:02:34.768 --> 00:02:35.677
- Oh yeah.

00:02:35.677 --> 00:02:37.007
That's super amazing.

00:02:37.007 --> 00:02:38.013
They look so cute.

00:02:38.013 --> 00:02:39.261
I can't wait to show my girlfriend.

00:02:39.261 --> 00:02:40.094
- [Adam] And the bunnies.

00:02:40.094 --> 00:02:40.927
- [Tyler] Yeah, and the buns.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.688
They're gonna be the
most excited about this.

00:02:42.688 --> 00:02:43.847
- Oh my goodness.

00:02:43.847 --> 00:02:45.249
Are you kidding?

00:02:45.249 --> 00:02:46.520
It looks so good.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.845
It looks just like her.

00:02:47.845 --> 00:02:52.551
Somehow you've captured her
eyes and her dumb expression

00:02:52.551 --> 00:02:54.768
that she has on her face constantly.

00:02:54.768 --> 00:02:57.969
The orange background is
like what sets it off.

00:02:57.969 --> 00:02:59.196
- This really turned out amazing.

00:02:59.196 --> 00:03:00.035
- Sweet! Awesome.

00:03:00.035 --> 00:03:02.202
- Thanks, man.
- Thank you.

